  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFA CSF02-23 Y2 PAYMENT &apos;ENSURING A JUST AND EQUITABLE RENEWABLE ENERGY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to ensure that the renewable energy transition is just and equitable for indigenous, impoverished, and traditionally marginalised communities in countries of the Global South. It will concentrate foremost on strengthening civil society by building an alliance between civil society organisations in the Global South, linking this coalition to advocacy efforts in the Global North and in China. Global Witness Trust will work in partnership with AFREWATCH, headquartered in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC), which advocates for the fair, equitable and transparent development of natural resources in Africa for the benefit of all.</narrative>
  </description>
